<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Dispel Evil</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 29), Paladin (guild level 45)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast dispel evil &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast dispel evil</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A powerful prayer that strikes at the life force of an evil being. The target 
must be of evil alignment, and you must not be evil yourself; otherwise the 
spell fails. The better your divine power and sphere, the harder it strikes.
</p><p>If the target is warded by protection from good, the first cast only breaks 
that ward. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on 
staffs and scrolls. Its dark twin, for those of evil heart, is 
<a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Good</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Good</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection from Good</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Alignment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>